        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CARCGR-ONE, Carre C Grip Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Carre Handleset with C Grip has a classic look that is rooted in a timeless silhouette. The stepped backplate paired with the traditional C-grip makes this Carre Entry Set in instant classic. The Carre One-Piece C Grip Entry Set will fit 1-3/4 inch to 2-1/4 inch thick doors that have 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from single cylinder or dummy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Carre Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for doors that are 84 inches or taller.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Carre C Grip Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Throw: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CARC-ONE-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262363\" target=\"new\"><b>Carre C-Grip Handleset Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the interior, the lever operates the latch and a thumbturn operates the deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset is does not function--neither locking nor latching.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nInside trim levers are handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to determine left or right handed.</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
