                "description": "The Carre Handleset with C Grip has a classic look that is rooted in a timeless silhouette. The stepped backplate paired with the traditional C-grip makes this Carre Entry Set in instant classic. The Carre One-Piece C Grip Entry Set will fit 1-3/4 inch to 2-1/4 inch thick doors that have 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from single cylinder or dummy functions.",
